  "bodyText": "Skip to content\nMen\nWomen\nAccessories\nTotal items in cart: 0\nFit guide\n\nFinding the perfect fit is essential for enjoying your new items, so we’re here to help you navigate your size options. Our products are crafted to fit true to size, ensuring that you can confidently select your usual size with ease. Whether you’re looking for a relaxed or tailored fit, our designs are made to complement your unique shape and style.\n\nTo assist you in choosing the right size, we provide detailed size charts for each item. These charts offer measurements that correspond to our sizing, allowing you to compare and find the best fit for your preferences. We encourage you to refer to these charts before making your purchase to increase the chances of getting the perfect fit on the first try. \n\nKeep in mind that different styles may have slight variations in fit. If you’re looking for a more fitted or looser silhouette, consider reviewing the product descriptions for additional insights. We strive to present clear information to help you make the best decision and feel comfortable in whatever you choose.\n\nShould you have any questions about sizing or fit, our customer service team is ready to assist you. We want you to be thrilled with your purchase, and we're committed to helping you find something that not only looks great but also fits perfectly.\n\n \n\nAbout us\n\nOur passion is sustainable, natural textiles. We create garments that can be enjoyed for generations to come.\n\nShop\nBestsellers\nMen\nWomen\nAccessories\nSupport\nFAQ\nContact\nFit guide\nGarment care\nOur story\nAbout us\nField notes\n© 2026 Heritage, Powered by Shopify"
